worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_facts_and_software_phrases.js"
  ceiling 1292
  rationale "Fact questions resolved through the fact cache, Wikidata and Wiktionary, and the software artifact and object-phrase scanner. Issue #658 cut this module out of one oversized worker file by line count; R1188-U5 named it after what it holds. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling moved 1151 to 1389 with issue #1175's object-phrase twin (objectPhraseArtifact and its boundary/lead tables mirroring object_phrase_artifact in src/solver_handlers/software_project.rs): the artifact kind is read only from the head noun of the authoring verb's object phrase, so a regex request mentioning a ZIP-code \"extension\" is not an extension project. Ceiling moved 1388 to 1290 for issue #1172 R3, because the hardcoded FACT_RESPONSE_TEMPLATES table, renderFactSummary and wikipediaSitelinkUrl left for the seeded fact_live_answer template that factLiveSummary renders in formal_ai_worker_factual_qa.js. Ceiling moved 1290 to 1292 (R1188-U5): the first comment lines say what the module holds."
